# Symbulator circuit book

title: Circuits for Lesson 3 of the Tutorial

[B11's Example 8.1]

j,0,1,10'm
r1,1,0,20'k

analysis: dc
note: In this problem, we use a current source (the j element) for the first time. Find the current through and the voltage drop across R1.
